{"seq":2,"slug":"build-variants","title":"构建变体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/build-and-release/build-variants","wordCount":573,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"构建变体\">构建变体</h1><p>Android 构建变体（Build Variants）由 Build Type 和 Product Flavor 组合而成，允许从同一个代码库生成多个不同版本的应用。这在管理开发/测试/生产环境、多品牌应用等场景中非常有用。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>构建变体围绕四个核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Build Type</strong>：定义编译与打包方式（<code>debug</code> / <code>release</code> / <code>staging</code>），控制可调试、混淆、资源压缩和签名。</li>\n<li><strong>Product Flavor</strong>：定义应用的不同版本（多品牌、多环境、免费/付费），配合 <code>flavorDimensions</code> 组织维度。</li>\n<li><strong>变体 = 维度笛卡尔积</strong>：多个 Flavor Dimension 与 Build Type 组合生成所有变体，可用 <code>beforeVariants</code> 过滤不需要的组合。</li>\n<li><strong>编译期配置注入</strong>：<code>buildConfigField</code> 生成代码常量、<code>resValue</code> 生成资源值，为不同变体注入环境相关配置。</li>\n<li><strong>Source Sets</strong>：每个变体可拥有独立代码与资源目录，优先级为「变体专用 &gt; 类型/风味专用 &gt; main」。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"build-types\">Build Types</h2><p>Build Type 定义构建的编译和打包方式，默认包含 <code>debug</code> 和 <code>release</code> 两种。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"android {&#10;    buildTypes {&#10;        debug {&#10;            isDebuggable = true&#10;            isMinifyEnabled = false&#10;            applicationIdSuffix = &quot;.debug&quot;&#10;            versionNameSuffix = &quot;-debug&quot;&#10;            buildConfigField(&quot;String&quot;, &quot;API_BASE_URL&quot;, &quot;\\&quot;https://dev-api.example.com/\\&quot;&quot;)&#10;            buildConfigField(&quot;Boolean&quot;, &quot;ENABLE_LOGGING&quot;, &quot;true&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        release {&#10;            isDebuggable = false&#10;            isMinifyEnabled = true&#10;            isShrinkResources = true&#10;            proguardFiles(&#10;                getDefaultProguardFile(&quot;proguard-android-optimize.txt&quot;),&#10;                &quot;proguard-rules.pro&quot;&#10;            )&#10;            buildConfigField(&quot;String&quot;, &quot;API_BASE_URL&quot;, &quot;\\&quot;https://api.example.com/\\&quot;&quot;)&#10;            buildConfigField(&quot;Boolean&quot;, &quot;ENABLE_LOGGING&quot;, &quot;false&quot;)&#10;            signingConfig = signingConfigs.getByName(&quot;release&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        create(&quot;staging&quot;) {&#10;            initWith(getByName(&quot;release&quot;))&#10;            applicationIdSuffix = &quot;.staging&quot;&#10;            versionNameSuffix = &quot;-staging&quot;&#10;            buildConfigField(&quot;String&quot;, &quot;API_BASE_URL&quot;, &quot;\\&quot;https://staging-api.example.com/\\&quot;&quot;)&#10;            buildConfigField(&quot;Boolean&quot;, &quot;ENABLE_LOGGING&quot;, &quot;true&quot;)&#10;            matchingFallbacks += listOf(&quot;release&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>android {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    buildTypes {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        debug {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            isDebuggable = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            isMinifyEnabled = false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            applicationIdSuffix = \".debug\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            versionNameSuffix = \"-debug\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            buildConfigField(\"String\", \"API_BASE_URL\", \"\\\"https://dev-api.example.com/\\\"\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            buildConfigField(\"Boolean\", \"ENABLE_LOGGING\", \"true\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        release {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            isDebuggable = false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            isMinifyEnabled = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            isShrinkResources = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            proguardFiles(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                getDefaultProguardFile(\"proguard-android-optimize.txt\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                \"proguard-rules.pro\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            buildConfigField(\"String\", \"API_BASE_URL\", \"\\\"https://api.example.com/\\\"\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            buildConfigField(\"Boolean\", \"ENABLE_LOGGING\", \"false\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            signingConfig = signingConfigs.getByName(\"release\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        create(\"staging\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            initWith(getByName(\"release\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            applicationIdSuffix = \".staging\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            versionNameSuffix = \"-staging\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            buildConfigField(\"String\", \"API_BASE_URL\", \"\\\"https://staging-api.example.com/\\\"\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            buildConfigField(\"Boolean\", \"ENABLE_LOGGING\", \"true\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            matchingFallbacks += listOf(\"release\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Build Type</th>\n<th>可调试</th>\n<th>代码混淆</th>\n<th>资源压缩</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>debug</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>日常开发调试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>release</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>正式发布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>staging</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>预发布测试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>initWith()</code> 可以基于已有的 Build Type 创建新类型，避免重复配置。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"product-flavors\">Product Flavors</h2><p>Product Flavor 定义应用的不同版本，通常用于多品牌、多环境或免费/付费版本。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"android {&#10;    flavorDimensions += listOf(&quot;version&quot;, &quot;market&quot;)&#10;&#10;    productFlavors {&#10;        create(&quot;free&quot;) {&#10;            dimension = &quot;version&quot;&#10;            applicationIdSuffix = &quot;.free&quot;&#10;            buildConfigField(&quot;Boolean&quot;, &quot;IS_PREMIUM&quot;, &quot;false&quot;)&#10;            buildConfigField(&quot;Int&quot;, &quot;MAX_ITEMS&quot;, &quot;10&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;        create(&quot;premium&quot;) {&#10;            dimension = &quot;version&quot;&#10;            applicationIdSuffix = &quot;.premium&quot;&#10;            buildConfigField(&quot;Boolean&quot;, &quot;IS_PREMIUM&quot;, &quot;true&quot;)&#10;            buildConfigField(&quot;Int&quot;, &quot;MAX_ITEMS&quot;, &quot;999999&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;        create(&quot;googlePlay&quot;) {&#10;            dimension = &quot;market&quot;&#10;        }&#10;        create(&quot;huawei&quot;) {&#10;            dimension = &quot;market&quot;&#10;            buildConfigField(&quot;String&quot;, &quot;STORE&quot;, &quot;\\&quot;huawei\\&quot;&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>android {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    flavorDimensions += listOf(\"version\", \"market\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    productFlavors {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        create(\"free\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            dimension = \"version\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            applicationIdSuffix = \".free\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            buildConfigField(\"Boolean\", \"IS_PREMIUM\", \"false\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            buildConfigField(\"Int\", \"MAX_ITEMS\", \"10\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        create(\"premium\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            dimension = \"version\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            applicationIdSuffix = \".premium\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            buildConfigField(\"Boolean\", \"IS_PREMIUM\", \"true\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            buildConfigField(\"Int\", \"MAX_ITEMS\", \"999999\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        create(\"googlePlay\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            dimension = \"market\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        create(\"huawei\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            dimension = \"market\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            buildConfigField(\"String\", \"STORE\", \"\\\"huawei\\\"\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;Flavor Dimensions&quot;&#10;        A[version: free / premium]&#10;        B[market: googlePlay / huawei]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;Build Types&quot;&#10;        C[debug / staging / release]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    A --&gt; D[组合]&#10;    B --&gt; D&#10;    C --&gt; D&#10;&#10;    D --&gt; E[freeGooglePlayDebug]&#10;    D --&gt; F[freeHuaweiDebug]&#10;    D --&gt; G[premiumGooglePlayRelease]&#10;    D --&gt; H[premiumHuaweiRelease]&#10;    D --&gt; I[...]&#10;&#10;    classDef variantStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class E,F,G,H variantStyle\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"Flavor Dimensions\"\n        A[version: free / premium]\n        B[market: googlePlay / huawei]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Build Types\"\n        C[debug / staging / release]\n    end\n\n    A --&gt; D[组合]\n    B --&gt; D\n    C --&gt; D\n\n    D --&gt; E[freeGooglePlayDebug]\n    D --&gt; F[freeHuaweiDebug]\n    D --&gt; G[premiumGooglePlayRelease]\n    D --&gt; H[premiumHuaweiRelease]\n    D --&gt; I[...]\n\n    classDef variantStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class E,F,G,H variantStyle</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"dimension\">Dimension</h2><p>多个 Flavor Dimension 的组合会产生笛卡尔积，生成所有可能的变体。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimension</th>\n<th>Flavors</th>\n<th>Build Types</th>\n<th>总变体数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 (version)</td>\n<td>free, premium</td>\n<td>debug, release</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 (version + market)</td>\n<td>free, premium × googlePlay, huawei</td>\n<td>debug, release</td>\n<td>8</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>过滤不需要的变体：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"android {&#10;    androidComponents {&#10;        beforeVariants { variantBuilder -&gt;&#10;            if (variantBuilder.productFlavors.containsAll(&#10;                listOf(&quot;version&quot; to &quot;free&quot;, &quot;market&quot; to &quot;huawei&quot;))&#10;            ) {&#10;                variantBuilder.enable = false&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>android {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    androidComponents {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        beforeVariants { variantBuilder -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (variantBuilder.productFlavors.containsAll(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                listOf(\"version\" to \"free\", \"market\" to \"huawei\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                variantBuilder.enable = false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"buildconfig-字段\">BuildConfig 字段</h2><p><code>buildConfigField</code> 在编译时生成常量，可以在代码中直接使用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// build.gradle.kts&#10;android {&#10;    defaultConfig {&#10;        buildConfigField(&quot;String&quot;, &quot;APP_VERSION&quot;, &quot;\\&quot;${project.version}\\&quot;&quot;)&#10;        buildConfigField(&quot;Long&quot;, &quot;BUILD_TIMESTAMP&quot;, &quot;${System.currentTimeMillis()}L&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 在代码中使用&#10;object AppConfig {&#10;    val apiBaseUrl: String = BuildConfig.API_BASE_URL&#10;    val isLoggingEnabled: Boolean = BuildConfig.ENABLE_LOGGING&#10;    val isPremium: Boolean = BuildConfig.IS_PREMIUM&#10;    val buildTimestamp: Long = BuildConfig.BUILD_TIMESTAMP&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Module&#10;@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)&#10;object NetworkModule {&#10;&#10;    @Provides&#10;    @Singleton&#10;    fun provideRetrofit(): Retrofit {&#10;        return Retrofit.Builder()&#10;            .baseUrl(BuildConfig.API_BASE_URL)&#10;            .build()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// build.gradle.kts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>android {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    defaultConfig {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        buildConfigField(\"String\", \"APP_VERSION\", \"\\\"${project.version}\\\"\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        buildConfigField(\"Long\", \"BUILD_TIMESTAMP\", \"${System.currentTimeMillis()}L\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在代码中使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>object AppConfig {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val apiBaseUrl: String = BuildConfig.API_BASE_URL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val isLoggingEnabled: Boolean = BuildConfig.ENABLE_LOGGING</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val isPremium: Boolean = BuildConfig.IS_PREMIUM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val buildTimestamp: Long = BuildConfig.BUILD_TIMESTAMP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>object NetworkModule {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Singleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun provideRetrofit(): Retrofit {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return Retrofit.Builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .baseUrl(BuildConfig.API_BASE_URL)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 使用 resValue 动态设置资源值&#10;android {&#10;    productFlavors {&#10;        create(&quot;free&quot;) {&#10;            dimension = &quot;version&quot;&#10;            resValue(&quot;string&quot;, &quot;app_name&quot;, &quot;MyApp Free&quot;)&#10;            resValue(&quot;color&quot;, &quot;brand_color&quot;, &quot;#4CAF50&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;        create(&quot;premium&quot;) {&#10;            dimension = &quot;version&quot;&#10;            resValue(&quot;string&quot;, &quot;app_name&quot;, &quot;MyApp Pro&quot;)&#10;            resValue(&quot;color&quot;, &quot;brand_color&quot;, &quot;#FF9800&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 使用 resValue 动态设置资源值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>android {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    productFlavors {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        create(\"free\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            dimension = \"version\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            resValue(\"string\", \"app_name\", \"MyApp Free\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            resValue(\"color\", \"brand_color\", \"#4CAF50\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        create(\"premium\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            dimension = \"version\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            resValue(\"string\", \"app_name\", \"MyApp Pro\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            resValue(\"color\", \"brand_color\", \"#FF9800\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"source-sets\">Source Sets</h2><p>每个构建变体可以拥有独立的源代码和资源目录。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"app/src/&#10;├── main/           # 所有变体共享&#10;│   ├── java/&#10;│   ├── res/&#10;│   └── AndroidManifest.xml&#10;├── debug/          # debug 类型专用&#10;│   └── java/&#10;├── release/        # release 类型专用&#10;│   └── java/&#10;├── free/           # free 风味专用&#10;│   ├── java/&#10;│   └── res/&#10;├── premium/        # premium 风味专用&#10;│   ├── java/&#10;│   └── res/&#10;└── freeDebug/      # 特定变体专用&#10;    └── java/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app/src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── main/           # 所有变体共享</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── java/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── res/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── AndroidManifest.xml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── debug/          # debug 类型专用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── java/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── release/        # release 类型专用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── java/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── free/           # free 风味专用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── java/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── res/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── premium/        # premium 风味专用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── java/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── res/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── freeDebug/      # 特定变体专用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── java/</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// main 中定义接口&#10;interface BillingService {&#10;    fun purchase(productId: String)&#10;    fun checkSubscription(): Boolean&#10;}&#10;&#10;// free/java/.../FreeBillingService.kt&#10;class FreeBillingServiceImpl : BillingService {&#10;    override fun purchase(productId: String) {&#10;        // 跳转到付费版下载页&#10;    }&#10;    override fun checkSubscription() = false&#10;}&#10;&#10;// premium/java/.../PremiumBillingService.kt&#10;class PremiumBillingServiceImpl : BillingService {&#10;    override fun purchase(productId: String) {&#10;        // 实际购买逻辑&#10;    }&#10;    override fun checkSubscription() = true&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// main 中定义接口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface BillingService {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun purchase(productId: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun checkSubscription(): Boolean</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// free/java/.../FreeBillingService.kt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class FreeBillingServiceImpl : BillingService {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun purchase(productId: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 跳转到付费版下载页</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun checkSubscription() = false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// premium/java/.../PremiumBillingService.kt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class PremiumBillingServiceImpl : BillingService {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun purchase(productId: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 实际购买逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun checkSubscription() = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Source Set 的优先级：变体专用 &gt; 类型/风味专用 &gt; main。同名资源文件会按优先级覆盖。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Build Type 定义编译方式（debug/release/staging），控制混淆、调试和签名</li>\n<li>Product Flavor 定义应用版本（free/premium、googlePlay/huawei），生成不同品牌或功能的应用</li>\n<li>Flavor Dimension 的笛卡尔积产生所有构建变体，可通过 <code>beforeVariants</code> 过滤</li>\n<li><code>buildConfigField</code> 和 <code>resValue</code> 在编译时注入配置值</li>\n<li>Source Sets 为不同变体提供独立的代码和资源目录</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"构建变体","id":"构建变体"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Build Types","id":"build-types"},{"level":2,"text":"Product Flavors","id":"product-flavors"},{"level":2,"text":"Dimension","id":"dimension"},{"level":2,"text":"BuildConfig 字段","id":"buildconfig-字段"},{"level":2,"text":"Source Sets","id":"source-sets"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Gradle 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/build-and-release/gradle-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"ProGuard 与 R8","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/build-and-release/proguard-and-r8"}}